  "instructions": [
    "Soak the cut potatoes in just-boiled water for thirty minutes, then drain and air-dry them.",
    "Coat the potatoes with one-third of the oil and air-fry them at 400°F until crisp and golden.",
    "Soften the onion in the remaining oil, then briefly cook the garlic and paprika.",
    "Stir in the tomato paste and canned tomatoes and simmer the sauce until slightly thickened.",
    "Spoon the smoky tomato sauce over the crisp potatoes and serve them hot."
  ],
